<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">07052026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Mohammed bin Salman has blocked US warplanes from Saudi airspace, forcing Donald Trump to scrap his unilateral plan to escort tankers through the Strait of Hormuz.</s> <s>Kuwait closed its skies too, and Iran said the climbdown vindicates its blockade strategy.</s> <s>This is the Saudi Arabia of twenty twenty-six... naming the price of US escalation, and Washington blinking first.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>In Lhasa, a five-year-old stopped speaking Tibetan within weeks of entering a Mandarin-only kindergarten.</s> <s>Beijing's education ministry mandated Mandarin instruction across all Tibetan schools in twenty twenty-one, and authorities have banned supplemental Tibetan classes in many counties.</s> <s>Parents describe it as a machine that pulls out their mother tongue, before a child is old enough to resist.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>One year on from India's Operation Sindoor strikes inside Pakistan, analysts warn both capitals now believe nuclear escalation is controllable.</s> <s>The cross-border taboo that held since nineteen ninety-nine is gone, and US mediation that once capped such crises is no longer assured.</s> <s>The next South Asian crisis will run on compressed timelines, with weaker external constraints, and elite confidence... the exact preconditions for it not being managed.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Pakistani drones killed seven students at Sayed Jamaluddin University in Afghanistan's Kunar province, local officials said.</s> <s>Islamabad calls the campaign counter-terrorism, but its strikes have hit schools, mosques, and family homes across eastern Afghanistan for months.</s> <s>Two Muslim neighbours, named victims and a named perpetrator, while Kabul and Islamabad still meet for talks brokered by Beijing.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Israel coordinated with Washington to bomb Beirut's Dahieh district, killing Hezbollah's Radwan commander and breaking November's Lebanon ceasefire.</s> <s>The strike ends six months of restraint that Trump had personally requested, and the agreement contained no enforcement mechanism for either side.</s> <s>Netanyahu and Foreign Minister Israel Katz decided one Hezbollah commander outweighed the deal that ended six months of cross-border war.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Hungary seized eighty-two million dollars from Ukraine's Oschadbank, citing money laundering — Kyiv calls it leverage over Druzhba pipeline oil.</s> <s>Viktor Orbán lost the April election, and his successor Peter Magyar takes office on Saturday with a pledge to normalize ties with Kyiv.</s> <s>Whether the gold returns may depend on how quickly Magyar can unwind a decade of Orbán's Moscow-aligned posture.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Israeli forces boarded twenty-two Global Sumud Flotilla vessels five hundred miles from Gaza and jailed two lead organizers on terrorism charges.</s> <s>The seizure happened in international waters near an EU member state, and no European government has acted before their detention review.</s> <s>The UN human rights office is now demanding release, while extraterritorial detention becomes routine through silence.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>US Commerce Secretary Howard Lutnick told the House Oversight Committee he cannot recall why his family spent two hours on Jeffrey Epstein's island in twenty twelve.</s> <s>The admission contradicts his past public claim that he had cut all ties with Epstein years earlier.</s> <s>The committee chair noted lying to Congress is a felony, and the cabinet's accountability for pre-office associations is now being tested by process, not media.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Australia will force gas producers to reserve twenty percent of east-coast export volumes for domestic use, after tripled prices triggered the country's first export quota.</s> <s>The reservation forces three Queensland producers to supply households first, starting July twenty twenty-seven.</s> <s>It's a developed-country precedent for resource-nationalist tools usually attributed to OPEC and Indonesia... Canberra clawing back supply through contracts, not subsidies.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>TSMC signed a thirty-year deal for the entire output of an offshore wind farm, anchoring project finance for Taiwan's renewable build-out.</s> <s>S&amp;P Global estimates its fabs will reach a quarter of Taiwan's electricity grid by twenty thirty, after Qatari facility damage cut LNG supply by a third.</s> <s>The AI-energy bottleneck is no longer an abstract forecast — a single chip foundry is now long enough to anchor a country's wind market.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Yango, the rebranded international arm of Russia's Yandex, launched corporate fleets in Karachi and Lahore, with Islamabad next.</s> <s>The B2B service offers Pakistani businesses thirty percent savings, with vehicles from three-seat cars to sixty-two-seat buses on a single dashboard.</s> <s>As Western tech firms retreat from sanctioned Russian lineage, Russian platforms are deepening their hold on commercial mobility in Muslim-majority markets.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Pakistan's regulator confirmed sixty-four billion rupees in capacity-charge savings in the first quarter, driven by idle independent power plants.</s> <s>The surplus will yield one rupee seventy-five paisa per unit of consumer relief between June and August.</s> <s>A May nineteenth hearing sets final rates, and rising fuel costs could still erode the household relief before bills arrive.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>South Korea's Kospi has surged one hundred and fourteen percent, leading every major index this year.</s> <s>Samsung and SK Hynix produce most of the world's high-bandwidth AI memory and together weigh roughly sixty percent of the country's MSCI index.</s> <s>Coronation Fund Managers warned the rally will normalise when US chip policy shifts, and the Seoul market has built a single point of failure.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Anthropic signed for all three hundred megawatts of SpaceX's new Memphis data centre, available within a month.</s> <s>The deal follows eighty-times revenue growth in the first quarter that overwhelmed the company's compute capacity, and reports place its valuation near nine hundred billion dollars.</s> <s>Anthropic is now exploring gigawatt-scale space-based facilities... the first AI lab to outgrow the terrestrial grid.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>A Nature paper reports a solar still that hits two hundred and seventy-eight percent apparent thermal efficiency, a record for passive desalination.</s> <s>Researchers borrowed reed-structured microchannels to synchronize water supply, vapor escape, and salt rejection, the bottleneck that defeated previous designs.</s> <s>The system runs stably in fifteen percent saline without crystallization, opening cheaper off-grid options for arid regions from the Sahel to South Asia, God willing.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Researchers identified two hundred and nineteen genomic regions where the same variant improves one trait while harming another.</s> <s>The variants cluster at intermediate allele frequencies, a signature of balancing selection that preserves human diversity across millennia.</s> <s>Human genetics, it turns out, trades one trait against another... and the conflict itself is what keeps the population varied.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A meta-analysis of thirty-two trials found AI decision-support cut cardiac all-cause mortality by sixteen percent.</s> <s>Across twenty-seven trials, medication adherence improved by fifty-nine percent, and workflow tools cut diagnostic time by up to two minutes and hospital stays by up to four days.</s> <s>The clinical case for cardiology AI has now crossed from promise to measurable lives saved.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The Kuiper Belt object two thousand two XV ninety-three holds an atmosphere no current model predicted.</s> <s>It falls below the known volatile-retention threshold, and many larger dwarf planets cannot keep gas envelopes at all.</s> <s>The finding reopens the Pluto classification debate, and forces planetary scientists to revisit what counts as a world.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Russia imposed hard blocks on YouTube, Telegram, and the VPNs used to bypass them, escalating from months of throttling to full platform cuts.</s> <s>The Kremlin has installed deep-packet-inspection equipment at every Russian internet provider, severing the country from global backbones.</s> <s>The splinternet is no longer a forecast — it's an operational reality, and Iran and Belarus are studying the template.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A Canadian study found generative AI use collapses the stylistic diversity that distinguishes one student's writing from another.</s> <s>Students themselves report reading the polished output as someone else's good essay, a measurable identity dissonance, not just a craft loss.</s> <s>The policy debate has been about cheating, but the unmeasured cost is monoculture of expression in a generation now learning to write through the model.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>North Korea's APT thirty-seven hacking group hid the BirdCall backdoor inside Chinese-made card games targeting ethnic Koreans living in China.</s> <s>Cybersecurity firm ESET traced the malware to developer Sqgame's Android apps, and total infection numbers remain unknown.</s> <s>Pyongyang's surveillance reach now extends to its own diaspora, embedded in entertainment software inside an allied country.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Meta erased Bangladesh's July twenty twenty-four uprising archive after false copyright claims, deleting evidence already submitted to the country's International Crimes Tribunal.</s> <s>The targeted users lack the legal capacity to file counter-notices, and Meta's appeals process did not verify the fraudulent claims.</s> <s>Atrocity evidence is now governed by platform copyright bots, not by courts, and history disappears with a takedown form.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
